  "changed": [
    "Root policy administrator registers separate immutable producer-bound output-policy versions without replacing or advancing default ingress. Caller cannot supply producer authority or gain file/worker/release/forwarding grants.",
    "One forced-RLS journalled binding commits with exact output contract and original receipt;current producer visibility requires live authority/root snapshot. Version changes retire only the preceding output version;root administrator can revoke independently of producer revocation.",
    "Five latest SQL default selectors retain all prior custody/authority/lease/format clauses and add only the legacy-state filter. Registry-only deployment does not configure ordinary ingress.",
    "Ordinary API and CLI expose register/list/exact status/revoke with strict decoding,scope,CSRF,stable keys and exact decision revisions. No processor consumes these registry rows yet."
  ],
